## [SPEC-FIXTURE]
## Category: Invalid
## Feature: Exhaustive Pattern Matching Enforcement
## Violation: Matching an enum without covering all variants or providing a fallback '_' arm.
## Expected Diagnostic: WON-MAT-001

enum Mode:
    Fast
    Safe
    Strict

fn label(m: Mode) -> i32:
    return match m:
        Mode::Fast => 1
        Mode::Safe => 2
